Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5223600,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-5223600","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:28Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5223600,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-5223600","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:28Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5223600,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5223600-1847286114030094","game_id":"steam-5223600","kind":"announcement","title":"The NEW match engine is LIVE!!","summary":"The new match is now live in the new Demo Update I rebuilt the matchday engine. Goals now are decided in live situations in which you are forced to choose what to do organically instead of being given three options from premade situations. A new clock Minutes with nothing happening go by fast. Chances for both teams play out in real time. When you have a decision to make, the clock stops and waits for you. In Settings you choose how fast the quiet minutes go by. The Skip button is gone: the spee","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T19:20:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030094","verified_at":"2026-10-21T21:21:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5223600-1846651706696774","game_id":"steam-5223600","kind":"announcement","title":"100 wishlists and news about the game engine coming soon!","summary":"100 WISHLISTS I am very happy to announce that we reached 100 wishlists today! It is great to see so many people like this type of game. This little game started as something I made for myself and my friends some time ago, but it kept evolving into what is now a fully playable game. So, to thank you all for the wishlists, I am announcing: POTRERO'S MATCH ENGINE Right now, the match engine you see when you play isn't really a match engine per se. The game already knows what is about to happen, an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T21:19:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696774","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5223600-1846018067936613","game_id":"steam-5223600","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO 1.3 LIVE!","summary":"Matches The pitch now anticipates goals: the move is built over the preceding seconds instead of being resolved the instant the goal happens. Goal animations start from the ball's actual position. Player movement: individual top speeds, a distinction between jogging and sprinting, a cost for changing direction, and the effect of fatigue late in the match. Continuous crowd sound that rises and falls with the run of play. Substitutes are grouped along one side of the pitch. Interface Redesigned sc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T16:10:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936613","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5223600-1846018067925059","game_id":"steam-5223600","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO 1.2 AVAILABLE!","summary":"Welcome! Taking into account the suggestions and feedback received from the demo, here is a list of changes and improvements to the game, INCLUDING A NEW LIVE PITCH FEATURE!New FeaturesLive Pitch during the match: View all eleven players from each team on the pitch with their formations and club jerseys, featuring plays reproduced in real-time.Live on-pitch commentary. The bottom log now only keeps track of match events: goals, cards, and decisions.Halftime at minute 45 featuring a match summary","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T05:51:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925059","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5223600-1845383656392625","game_id":"steam-5223600","kind":"announcement","title":"DE POTRERO demo is out!","summary":"Hey everyone!I'm really happy to announce that the De Potrero demo is finally out foryou to play. I know it still has a few small bugs. I'll keep updating it to iron themout, both in this demo build and in the base game. Feedback is alwayswelcome and it's honestly my number one source of ideas, and of fixes forwhatever comes up.In this playable demo you get the first 3 seasons with one player. Theymight get lucky, or not: a star from a young age, or just another one ofthe crowd.For now there's n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T05:55:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392625","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5223600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:30:02Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:30:01Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5223600":"2026-10-26T09:30:02Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5223600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:30:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:30:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:30:01Z"},"5308910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:30:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:30:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:30:02Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5223600","app_id":5223600,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:41Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"93d91ea11143f2ed35ec39972506592892a9c8a14e3e9d0d5702295dd5b43076","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"You are a footballer, straight from the youth ranks until your last season. One decision at a time: when to shoot, when to pass, what to say to the press. A whole career decided by what you choose, and a little by your luck.","publishers":[{"name":"Realoid Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Realoid Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793674800,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full","is_early_access":true},"trailers":{"other_trailers":[{"trailer_name":"De Potrero trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1789891386","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"5223600/1696565269/0dff226b0375d01206fbfabc9719cecfb8d583f4/1789891167/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"5223600/1696565269/0dff226b0375d01206fbf